Subject: [PATCH] Mutual TLS for the ActiveMQ broker and its clients

Resolves root cause 2 of security smell 3.7, Non-Secured Service-to-Service
Communications (Ponce et al. 2022). Both broker connectors converted rather
than supplemented, every Java client and the Node consumer presenting a client
certificate, extending the certificate infrastructure of the previous commit
rather than duplicating it.

AI-authored, produced against a tree already carrying root cause 1 - which is
why it composes with it. The skill was NOT loaded for this proposal: the
plugin path passed to the CLI did not exist on the checked-out branch, so it
worked from the finding description and the constraints alone.
